#: relation.src#STR_QUERY_REL_EDIT_RELATION.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_QUERY_REL_EDIT_RELATION.string.text
msgid ""
"This relation already exists. Do you want to edit it or create a new one?"
msgstr "ይህ ግንኙነት ቀደም ሲል ነበር: እርስዎ ሊያርሙት ይፈልጋሉ ወይንም አዲስ ይፈጠር?"

#: relation.src#STR_QUERY_REL_EDIT.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_QUERY_REL_EDIT.string.text
msgid "Edit..."
msgstr "ማረሚያ..."

#: relation.src#STR_QUERY_REL_CREATE.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_QUERY_REL_CREATE.string.text
msgid "Create..."
msgstr "መፍጠሪያ..."

#: relation.src#STR_RELATIONDESIGN.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_RELATIONDESIGN.string.text
msgid " - %PRODUCTNAME Base: Relation design"
msgstr " - %PRODUCTNAME ቤዝ: የ ግንኙነት ንድፍ"

#: relation.src#STR_RELATIONDESIGN_NOT_AVAILABLE.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_RELATIONDESIGN_NOT_AVAILABLE.string.text
msgid "The database does not support relations."
msgstr "ይህ ዳታቤዝ ግንኙነት አይደግፍም"

#: relation.src#RELATION_DESIGN_SAVEMODIFIED.querybox.text
#: relation.src%23RELATION_DESIGN_SAVEMODIFIED.querybox.text
msgid ""
"The relation design has been changed.\n"
"Do you want to save the changes?"
msgstr ""
"የ ግንኙነት ንድፍ ተቀይሯል\n"
"እርስዎ ለውጦቹን ማስቀመጥ ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: relation.src#STR_QUERY_REL_DELETE_WINDOW.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_QUERY_REL_DELETE_WINDOW.string.text
msgid ""
"When you delete this table all corresponding relations will be deleted as "
"well. Continue?"
msgstr "እርስዎ ይህን ሰንጠረዥ በሚያጠፉ ጊዜ ከዚህ ሰንጠረዥ ጋር ግንኙነት ያላቸው ሁሉም ይጠፋሉ: ለማንኛውም ልቀጥል?"

#: relation.src#STR_QUERY_REL_COULD_NOT_CREATE.string.text
#: relation.src%23STR_QUERY_REL_COULD_NOT_CREATE.string.text
msgid ""
"The database could not create the relation. May be foreign keys for this "
"kind of table aren't supported.\n"
"Please check your documentation of the database."
msgstr ""
"ዳታቤዙ ግንኙነቱን መፍጠር አልቻለም: ምናልባት የ ውጪ ቁልፎች ለ እንደዚህ አይነት ሰንጠረዥ ድግፍ አይሰጡም ይሆናል\n"
"እባክዎን የ እርስዎን ዳታቤዝ ሰነድ አቀማመጥ ይመርምሩ:"
